{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】尖沙咀兩名女子被的士撞傷送院。</p>\n<p>其中一名女子腳部受傷，送到伊利沙伯醫院治理。凌晨3時許，現場消息指，兩名內地女子乘坐的士在康達徑近科學館徑落車期間，與的士司機發生爭執，的士開車離開時，懷疑撞到該兩名女子，警方正調查案件。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T00:03:14.285978+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T23:24:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T23:56:45.934348+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T23:56:45.934348+00:00","content_hash":"457746d9222577209126c104aa5e0d7ea88e762fdee7bcba1e81ccf7d56e6e8d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}